  "main": "// Blue waves roll along the strip. Written for Specter Studio's tests (MIT).\nexport function beforeRender(delta) {\n  t = time(0.03)\n}\nvar t = 0\nexport function render(index) {\n  hsv(0.62, 1, wave(t + index / 8))\n}\n"
